# Cloudflare Pages headers. Always revalidate HTML and the app's JS/CSS so a new
# deploy takes effect immediately for every viewer (console, OBS, phones, guests)
# instead of being masked by a stale browser cache. Revalidation is cheap: the
# browser sends an ETag and gets a 304 when nothing changed.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Fonts/icons are fine to cache hard (their contents don't change under the same name).
/lineawesome/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
